"Swipeable Chapter Images – Easily look through all chapter artwork while listening. Peek ahead or go back to the last image discussed in the podcast without losing your listening position." = "Swipeable Chapter Images – Easily look through all chapter artwork while listening. Peek ahead or go back to the last image discussed in the podcast without losing your listening position.";
"Basic CarPlay Integration – Take your podcasts on the road with full CarPlay support." = "Basic CarPlay Integration – Take your podcasts on the road with full CarPlay support.";
"Basic iPad & macOS Support – Enjoy an optimized experience on iPad and Mac with a new, dedicated layout!" = "Basic iPad & macOS Support – Enjoy an optimized experience on iPad and Mac with a new, dedicated layout!";
"Filter Episodes Your Way – Instantly sort your episodes by All, Unlistened, Started, Favorites, or Downloaded. No more endless scrolling!" = "Filter Episodes Your Way – Instantly sort your episodes by All, Unlistened, Started, Favorites, or Downloaded. No more endless scrolling!";
